      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَيُوصٌ</span></b>  A beast (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَابَّةٌ</span>) <i>that takes fright, and
runs away at random;</i> (K;) <i>turning away from
that which its master desires:</i> (TA:) a mule <i>evil
in disposition.</i> (TA.)

